{
  "id": "ACT.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Gadiyeeda Giijasoodiga 11",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Betaro ghoadaw ganiiseeda Yerusalemu iita",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwayiiy giijasoodiga ea fuga siduupcheewi mida ng'eanyiida Yahudi gideaba eara fuga Eemoojiga nimwas ng'asheega ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Betaro Yerusalemu, ak geenyareeksa nea gwasheang'nyi sea fuga ghasmeahooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea geeyeesha, “Ang'iing'i ghwasaan anda guwi heeda fuga miyeayaat ghasmeahooda ak giimbuucheewi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iidu gwarukuta Betaro ng'asheega ghayi dea nea ghoang'eada gidaghayi ng'eata: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghayi nea geandi jeeda mujiineeda Yopa nea ghaamwaashchi ASEETA; nea geandi jeeda ruweanga, geahiimnaan giduurji hang'da haw, nea geerareang'na humng'eeda, nea geeng'waanyaan meatkwajeega sean asang'wan; ak geanung' ghwaan heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geang'weersi jeedida nea neeki ak ghaadaayi diyeanga ea diyeanga aga suurja ea diyeanga beawa jeesinga ea dariidaka humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaayiinyi ghuuta eeshiinean, ‘Betaro, Ng'eada; nuusa ak giyaagi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geayeeshi, ‘Manda Ng'utamiida; aba gideaba gilinyoo gaba ririnnyaan ghana gida mii miy miighanyi dayiin ghuuteanyu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanya ghuutida leabu humng'eedean gicha nea gwayi, ‘Haleanjeeda niimmiidu ASEETA adiguuri haleanjeeda gealaan.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanji gabiikta niba samwagu, iidu geatealda haleanjeeda sean humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghapka fih samwagu aba geeshangiga siicheakseani leabu Gaysariya ak ghapka gheeda eandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeeshiinean Guroorooda, adeayeewana fiisu nea adibeali. Baloojisu alah siduupcheewiin eara saawa geadeayeewi, fiisu gheeh Gorneliyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukuneasa gidaghayi hissiinda malaykajeanda miinaada ak gwayeesha, ‘Ajeakta siida ng'eanyiida Yopa gaguursa siisi siguura Simon, bea gheawunga suuk siguura Betaro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niny gaygwarukuneey ng'asheega jea gwalealneey, ang'iing'i ea fugeaba gheang'u.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani duu dang'eada ghuuta balooldean, hean gwashuubeesa Guroorooda Ghaydit gawuurji gidaghayi sinyasti aseasa aba mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaapkaachi ng'asheega ghayi rugu Ng'utamiida bea gideaba, ‘Yohana goobaatiisana beega, ak agooga gajeepaatiisananeegwa Guroorooda Ghaydit.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iiniidaw ASEETA eara fuga eemoojiga suuk Guroorooda Ghaydit gidagoondaneasa aseasa damanda simwaseawi Ng'utamiida was Yesu Gristo, asi aniini geawooschi ng'eaha daheawa ng'asheega ASEETA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy ng'asheesu ghwasiinda. Ng'ata geakghambiit ASEETA nea geeyi, “ASEETA niidaw eara Eemoojiga gheata duukuunooda ak ghwanyas eaweega.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ganiiseeda Antiyokiya.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fugiga ghayi darda aba sawanadeeda bunu aba badayda Stefanohiin gaweay ea gwasheagiidi ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Foynike ea Saypras ea Antiyokiya, nea gwarukwiida ng'asheanda aba heeda fuga Yahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwanda fuga mwaatkwa, was fuga leabu Saypras ea Girene, amadu nea ghapka ng'eanyiida Antiyokiya goobalool eara fuga Yunani, nea gwarukwiida iita Ng'utamiida was Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadiyeani geesina uurda Ng'utamiida, hean ghamwas fuga saang'a ak ghoahaada buuneeda yamsa geat Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageawiit iiteaba ng'asheesu ea ghwahita iidiga fuga ganiiseeda mida Yerusalemu, geecheakta Barnaba gawa Antiyokiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hita hooweani ak ghwadaah dagheerjeanduumeeda ASEETA, gahoosan; ak gwayeesha fugiga oopiidana jeedeaba doobiiwnadi iteang'wean aba heeda Ng'utamiida nea ghwarjeang'da; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba niny siida miy gil, ak gwandeawa Guroorooda Ghaydit ea masaweega, ak ghapka fuga saang'a heeda Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gawa Barnaba ng'eanyiida Darso gagasa Sawli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghwanyas ak gweadu ng'eanyiida Antiyokiya. Aba gideaba nindeayi gweayda mughuush sea fuga ganiisa, ak ghoanaal fuga saang'a; nea aba Antiyokiya ea heeda madeeda siisheeda eeguura giinealanga fuga Gristohi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba eawoojigiga ghapka sibanga leabu Yerusalemu ea ghwahidu Antiyokiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada siyagi aba jeedeaba fugiga siguura Agabo ak gwarugu ramooraneadaanyi aba uurda Guroorooda, gideaba gayghang'eat geejeeda ng'waan aba muunda ng'eanyiida sean; ghang'eada damanda waseewa Glaudio sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat fugiga was giinealangean ak gaba nih aat gida ammu wassean, ak geeyeassa weeta fuga siduupcheewi mida Yudeyaan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghoawaam lapiyeeda nyaawa, amahit geataw Barnaba ea Sawli ghwaat ea ghwaahiita heeda gweargwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
